# Development Goal

Build a production-grade ride aggregation platform that demonstrates:

* Full Stack Development
* System Design
* PostgreSQL
* Redis
* Realtime Systems
* Docker
* Queue Processing
* Scalable Backend Architecture

while targeting Software Engineer roles in top-tier product and service companies.
